  m_Name: Hint_Step_21_PrinterPermissions
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: Hint
    text: 'The printer''s <b>Security</b> tab.


      Grant <b>STUDENTS</b> the
      <b>Print</b> permission, and remove <b>Everyone</b>.


      Same principle
      as the shared folder: the right goes to the group, and Everyone left in place
      undoes the restriction you just made.'
